Error [E0433]: This String value is thrown away
  --> tainted_credential_to_jsonl_is_e0722.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     jsonl.to_string(rows)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `run` has no return type, so it returns nothing and the value of its last line is lost
 Fix: If `run` should return it, write `-> String` after its parameter list; to discard it on purpose, write `.drop("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433

Error [E0722]: A `Credential` value is denied at `jsonl.to_string`
  --> tests/ui/taint/tainted_credential_to_jsonl_is_e0722.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     jsonl.to_string(rows)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `jsonl.to_string` writes to a log, terminal, or serialized output, where a credential would leak
 Fix: Log a non-secret field, or pass the value through a matching `#Scrub(Credential)` function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0722
